WEBVTT

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:08.125
[gasps] No...

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:10.750
I know change is scary,
but watch.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.875
-I'm so excited.
-[gasps]

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.625
All right.
Welcome to our team, Michigan.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:26.750
That is not Riley.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:28.333
I know. It's a better Riley.

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:30.708
A Riley who won't be alone
next year.

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.625
We build her
a new Sense of Self.

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.791
A brand-new her.

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:36.458
No, no, no!

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:37.625
You can't go down there
with that.

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:39.916
Over my dead flaming body!

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.125
I am truly sorry.

00:00:43.291 --> 00:00:45.458
I was so looking forward
to working with you guys.

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:47.375
Hey, hey! What do you think
you're doing?

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:48.458
Get off me!

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:49.875
Riley's life
is more complex now.

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:52.625
It requires more sophisticated
emotions than all of you.

00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:55.166
You just aren't what
she needs anymore, Joy.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.250
[gasps]

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:57.875
How dare you, madam!

00:00:57.958 --> 00:00:59.750
You can't just bottle us up!

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.458
Oh! That's a great idea.

00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:03.541
-[all grunting]
-[Fear] I can't breathe.

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:04.625
I can't breathe!

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:05.708
It's not forever.

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:06.875
It's just
until Riley makes varsity,

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.958
or until she turns 18,
or maybe forever.

00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:10.125
I don't know.
We'll have to see.

00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:11.416
-Bye!
-[Joy] Anxiety!

00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:13.083
-Riley needs us!
-[all clamoring]

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:15.041
Okay.

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:16.958
Don't worry, Riley.
You're in good hands.

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.291
Now let's change
everything about you.

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.333
[Embarrassment grunting]

00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:26.416
Huh?

00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:29.375
[Embarrassment exclaims]

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:31.958
Quick question. How do we
build a new Riley,

00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:34.083
which I'm loving, by the way,
amazing concept,

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:37.625
if it took them 13 years
to build the old one?

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:39.750
Well, good news is we're not
starting from scratch.

00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:42.125
I wanna plant one.

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.416
-Next time.
-[groans]

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.916
[crackling]

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.208
-[twangs]
-[Riley echoing] If I'm

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.166
a Fire Hawk,
I won't be alone.

00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:59.250
[crackling]

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:00.625
[siren wailing]

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:02.166
[Sadness crying]

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.583
[Anger] No, no, no!

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:05.416
Let us out now!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.583
[Disgust] No, stop!
Stop! Let us out!

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:09.750
[Fear] Uh, Joy...

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:20.875
[crying] We're gonna
be in here forever.

00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:22.083
[crying]

00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:26.958
[Fear gasps]
Where are you putting us?

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:29.000
The same place we keep
all of Riley's secrets.

00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:30.208
We're not secrets.

00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:31.875
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.
"We're not secrets.

00:02:31.958 --> 00:02:33.500
"We're making a big mistake."

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:35.000
[Frank] Never heard
that before.

00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:36.666
-[Frank and Dave laughing]
-[vault door shuts]

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.083
We are suppressed emotions!

00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:43.916
[Anger] Let us out! Right now!

00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:45.875
No, no, no.
Riley's gonna be fine.

00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:47.208
Totally fine.

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.916
[male voice] Hey, there.
You know what we call that?

00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:51.125
Denial.

00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:52.708
Can you say denial?

00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:54.666
-[all gasp]
-Hi, friends.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.708
Welcome. It's so good to have
you here with us today.

00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.791
[laughs] It's Bloofy!

00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:02.958
From that preschool show
Riley used to like?

00:03:03.041 --> 00:03:04.166
That's right!

00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:06.083
And here's a little secret.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:07.708
[Fear exclaims]

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:10.166
[whispers]
Riley still likes the show.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:11.750
[singing]
♪ Stomp like an elephant ♪

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:12.958
♪ Scurry like a mouse ♪

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:15.666
♪ Make your way down
To Bloofy's house! ♪

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:16.916
Please kill me.

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:19.125
Bloofy,
we're in a real pickle.

00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:20.958
Could you help us
get out of here?

00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:23.833
Uh-oh.
We're gonna need your help.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.791
Can you find a way out?

00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:29.250
-Who are you talking to?
-My friends.

00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:31.541
Do you see a key?

00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:34.083
Hmm.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.708
I don't either.

00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:36.875
Okay, we're doomed.

00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:37.958
[male voice 2] Indeed.

00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:41.500
Welcome to your eternal fate.

00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:43.625
[gasps] Lance Slashblade?

00:03:43.791 --> 00:03:45.708
But he's
a video game character.

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:46.958
Why is he here?

00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:49.500
Yeah, I always thought Riley
had a secret crush on him.

00:03:49.666 --> 00:03:51.208
I never saw the appeal.

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:53.416
I long to be a hero,

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:56.083
but darkness haunts my past.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.250
-[all assenting]
-[Anger] I get it.

00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:58.541
I'm in a hundred percent.

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:00.458
[growling]

00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:02.125
-Uh... Who's that?
-Oh!

00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:04.875
That's Riley's
Deep Dark Secret.

00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:06.833
What... What is the secret?

00:04:07.833 --> 00:04:08.916
You don't wanna know.

00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:10.416
Riley's secrets,

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.916
a rogue emotion
has taken over Headquarters.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.791
Now, if you could just
open the jar...

00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:16.833
Hey, kids,
let's learn some Latin.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.750
Do you know quid pro quo?

00:04:18.916 --> 00:04:20.416
We get you out of that jar,

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.125
then you get us
out of this safe.

00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:23.291
No, Bloofy.

00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:25.958
Their destiny
is not ours to change.

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.666
We were all banished here,

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:30.291
deemed unfit, worthless.

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:32.375
[gasps]
Don't you dare say that.

00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:34.625
You do not deserve
to be thrown away.

00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:35.958
Uh, one second, Lance.

00:04:36.125 --> 00:04:38.375
Don't you remember
his power move?

00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:39.958
-[video game sounds beeping]
-I'm coming for you, Riley!

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:42.041
Oh, yeah? Watch this!

00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:43.666
[video game chiming]

00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:44.791
[Riley] Come on!

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:46.541
You listen to me,
Lance Slashblade.

00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:48.708
No one is totally worthless.

00:04:48.875 --> 00:04:52.083
But I am a warrior cursed
with a feeble attack.

00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:55.416
Then you must make your curse
your gift.

00:04:56.708 --> 00:04:58.500
Shield yourself, my friends,

00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:01.083
for I shall set you all free!

00:05:01.916 --> 00:05:03.333
[Lance grunting]

00:05:05.958 --> 00:05:06.958
Hey, little help?

00:05:07.041 --> 00:05:08.541
[growls]

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.541
[glass shatters]

00:05:10.625 --> 00:05:11.916
Great job, Dark Secret.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.000
[grunts]

00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:14.958
Now it's your turn to help us.

00:05:15.125 --> 00:05:17.708
My pouch has just the thing
to get us out of here.

00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:21.541
Everybody say, "Oh, Pouchy!"

00:05:22.333 --> 00:05:24.583
[all] Oh, Pouchy!

00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:26.041
[♪ amusing music plays]

00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:29.500
Hi, everybody. I'm Pouchy.

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:31.208
Pouchy, we need to escape.

00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:33.041
Do you have anything
that can help us?

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:34.666
I have lots of items.

00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:37.083
Which one do you think
will work the best?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.458
A tomato,

00:05:38.625 --> 00:05:39.791
a frog,

00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:42.000
or exploding dynamite?

00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:43.583
Oh, for crying out loud.

00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:45.041
[explosion]

00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:47.916
Yay! We did it, everyone!

00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:49.166
Let's all sing

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.666
the "We did it" song.
[inhales deeply]

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:51.958
[all] No time!

00:05:52.458 --> 00:05:54.666
Thank you, friends. I must...
[grunts]

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.958
I must be leaving you.

00:05:57.125 --> 00:05:59.416
What about Dark Secret?

00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:02.708
Not yet.

